{"cantica":"inferno","cantoNumber":11,"title":"Canto XI","totalDuration":321.416,"segments":[{"id":1,"speaker":"narrator","text":"On the edge of a towering cliff\nformed by massive rocks broken in a circle,\nwe came upon an even more savage crowd.\nThere, because of the horrible\nexcess of stench thrown up from the deep abyss,\nwe pulled back behind the shelter\nof a great tomb, where I saw an inscription\nthat read: \"I hold Pope Anastasius,\nwhom Photinus led from the righteous path.\"","startTime":0,"endTime":22.48,"words":[{"word":"On","start":0.081,"end":0.281},{"word":"the","start":0.281,"end":0.401},{"word":"edge","start":0.401,"end":0.641},{"word":"of","start":0.641,"end":0.801},{"word":"a","start":0.801,"end":1.081},{"word":"towering","start":1.081,"end":1.601},{"word":"cliff","start":1.601,"end":2.161},{"word":"formed","start":2.161,"end":2.601},{"word":"by","start":2.601,"end":2.801},{"word":"massive","start":2.801,"end":3.281},{"word":"rocks","start":3.281,"end":3.841},{"word":"broken","start":3.841,"end":4.041},{"word":"in","start":4.041,"end":4.241},{"word":"a","start":4.241,"end":4.508},{"word":"circle,","start":4.508,"end":5.201},{"word":"we","start":5.201,"end":5.361},{"word":"came","start":5.361,"end":5.681},{"word":"upon","start":5.681,"end":5.921},{"word":"an","start":5.921,"end":6.161},{"word":"even","start":6.161,"end":6.481},{"word":"more","start":6.481,"end":6.721},{"word":"savage","start":6.721,"end":7.241},{"word":"crowd.","start":7.241,"end":8.241},{"word":"There,","start":8.241,"end":8.881},{"word":"because","start":8.881,"end":9.161},{"word":"of","start":9.161,"end":9.281},{"word":"the","start":9.281,"end":9.521},{"word":"horrible","start":9.521,"end":10.001},{"word":"excess","start":10.001,"end":10.401},{"word":"of","start":10.401,"end":10.641},{"word":"stench","start":10.641,"end":11.121},{"word":"thrown","start":11.121,"end":11.441},{"word":"up","start":11.441,"end":11.601},{"word":"from","start":11.601,"end":11.761},{"word":"the","st