":214.971}]},{"id":17,"speaker":"virgil","text":"\"Why does your mind wander so\nfrom its usual sharpness?\nOr where else are your thoughts straying?\nDon't you remember those words\nin your Ethics that thoroughly discuss\nthe three dispositions Heaven cannot abide—\nIncontinence, Malice, and mad Bestiality—\nand how Incontinence offends God less\nand draws less blame?\nIf you consider this teaching well\nand recall who those souls are\nundergoing penance up outside,\nyou'll clearly see why they're separated\nfrom these criminals, and why divine Justice\nstrikes them with a gentler hammer.\"","startTime":215.096,"endTime":251.016,"words":[{"word":"\"Why","start":215.096,"end":215.416},{"word":"does","start":215.416,"end":215.576},{"word":"your","start":215.576,"end":215.736},{"word":"mind","start":215.736,"end":216.216},{"word":"wander","start":216.216,"end":216.696},{"word":"so","start":216.696,"end":217.016},{"word":"from","start":217.016,"end":217.256},{"word":"its","start":217.256,"end":217.416},{"word":"usual","start":217.416,"end":217.976},{"word":"sharpness?","start":217.976,"end":219.176},{"word":"Or","start":219.176,"end":219.416},{"word":"where","start":219.416,"end":219.656},{"word":"else","start":219.656,"end":219.976},{"word":"are","start":219.976,"end":220.136},{"word":"your","start":220.136,"end":220.296},{"word":"thoughts","start":220.296,"end":220.616},{"word":"straying?","start":220.616,"end":221.816},{"word":"Don't","start":221.816,"end":222.056},{"word":"you","start":222.056,"end":222.136},{"word":"remember","start":222.136,"end":222.656},{"word":"those","start":222.656,"end":222.936},{"word":"words","start":222.936,"end":223.296},{"word":"in","start":223.296,"end":223.416},{"word":"your","start":223.416,"end":223.656},{"word":"Ethics","start":223.656,"end":224.216},{"word":"that","start":224.216,"end":224.536},{"word":"thoroughly","start":224.536,"end":224.936},{"word":"discuss","start":224.936,"end":225.576},{"word":"the","start":225.576,"end":